.\"             -*-Nroff-*-
.\"
.TH "heic2stw" 1 "04 Jun 2026" "heic2stw" "User Commands"
.SH "نام (NAME)"
heic2stw \- convert from GNOME Timed Wallpaper to the Simple Timed Wallpaper format
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.B heic2stw
[options] [HEIC file]
.sp
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
heic2stw converts HEIC dynamic wallpaper files to the Simple Timed Wallpaper (STW) format, which can be used with timed wallpaper systems.
.sp
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.sp
.TP
.B \-V or \-\-version
Show the current version.
.PP
.SH "نسخه (VERSION)"
5.14.3
.SH "نویسنده (AUTHOR)"
.B heic2stw
was written by Alexander F. Rødseth <xyproto@archlinux.org>